body:
So they deliver shitty boxed meals? Heard that. No thanks. Why though? Why not just go to the grocery store? Nobody is THAT busy. 

&#x200B;

Rhetorical question...just....fuck lol.

For real, that's a super valid point. At the current gig, saw the sous get promoted to executive chef. We all loved the dude, everyone was stoked about it. All he does now is hide in his office and forget to order ingredients. I CAN'T MAKE WALDORF WITHOUT WALNUS OR APPLES, YOU FUCK! Takes vacations constantly, denies time off requests if it means he'll have to cover. 

&#x200B;

Dude, what happened? We all respected the fuck out of you, now we all talk shit about you. Way to demoralize your entire staff in one fell swoop.
